<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="es" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.180"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L21">I'm sorry, baby</text><text for="L20">Come here and let me in</text><text for="L23">It's been a long time since I fell in love with anyone</text><text for="L22">Don't try to fall in love with me or I won't sing for you</text><text for="L25">To do it again, but my time is gold</text><text for="L24">And I'm here for you</text><text for="L27">I'm sorry, baby</text><text for="L26">I will never be spiteful to anyone</text><text for="L29">It's been a long time since I fell in love with anyone</text><text for="L28">Don't try to fall in love with me or I won't sing for you</text><text for="L30">And I'm here for you</text><text for="L32">I will never be spiteful to anyone</text><text for="L31">To do it again, but my time is gold</text><text for="L34">Life is only one and I live in the present</text><text for="L33">I tell you not to even try, eh</text><text for="L36">Now you want me for you, mama, you're demanding</text><text for="L35">I like it when you're horny</text><text for="L38">But she suddenly gets romantic</text><text for="L37">And naughty, excellent</text><text for="L39">And I don't believe in love</text><text for="L41">And it makes me think</text><text for="L40">Cupid is an asshole, that bastard always lies to me</text><text for="L43">I know how it ends, I won't even start</text><text for="L42">In things that won't happen</text><text for="L45">Tell me if you're going to stay</text><text for="L44">Whatever happens, I won't force it</text><text for="L47">For this, yes, but for that no</text><text for="L46">Making love, touching each other</text><text for="L49">To fuck yes, but to be serious no</text><text for="L48">Making love, touching each other</text><text for="L1">I wasn't expecting anything</text><text for="L2">When meeting you last night</text><text for="L50">For that no</text><text for="L3">It was just another</text><text for="L4">A great night, something special</text><text for="L52">Don't try to fall in love with me or I won't sing for you</text><text for="L5">But something is so different</text><text for="L51">I'm sorry, baby</text><text for="L6">Everything around me spins around suddenly</text><text for="L10">Without making a fuss</text><text for="L54">And I'm here for you</text><text for="L7">You and I, the singular changed</text><text for="L53">It's been a long time since I fell in love with anyone</text><text for="L8">Without fear, daddy, come and give me more</text><text for="L12">Flow now</text><text for="L56">I will never be spiteful to anyone</text><text for="L9">Come without fear</text><text for="L11">Don't close yourself to this world</text><text for="L55">To do it again, but my time is gold</text><text for="L14">Don't try to define it</text><text for="L13">Come with me</text><text for="L57">I'm sorry, baby</text><text for="L16">Honey, come here</text><text for="L15">And come here</text><text for="L18">Come here</text><text for="L17">Come here and let me in</text><text for="L19">Honey, come here</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Benito Martínez Ocasio</songwriter><songwriter>Julieta Venegas</songwriter><songwriter>Marcos Efrain Masis</songwriter></songwriters><audio lyricOffset="-0.186" role="spatial"/></iTunesMetadata>
